{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_210_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_210","textTraditional":"一、三十年。春王正月，公在乾侯。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_210_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_210","textTraditional":"二、夏六月庚辰，晉侯去疾卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_210_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_210","textTraditional":"三、秋八月，葬晉頃公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_210_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_210","textTraditional":"四、冬十有二月，吳滅徐，徐子章禹奔楚。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}